  "text_content": "Menu Student Files Classes Instructor Open submenu Reports Open submenu Set Class Schedule School Permits Close submenu Instructor Instructor Schedule Open submenu Instructor Reports Open submenu My Signatures Close submenu Instructor Schedule Booked Appointments Specify Hours Close submenu Instructor Reports Work Summary To Do Lists Close submenu Reports AQTR Registrations Ilan Preisler logout Self-Evaluation of In-Car Session Practical Session #5 Verma, Adih 1. In the Learner's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Strengths: Awareness of vehicles around on the road, Handling of the vehicle on the road, maintaining speed limits, blinkers Weaknesses: starting to break sooner on stop signs, checking blind spots on lane changes 2. In the Instructor's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Strengths starting stopping turning Weaknesses: double stops blind spot before turning Weaknesses Student Student Signature Verma, Adih Jan 7, 2026 Instructor Instructor Signature Guy Zamir L11174 Save",
